---
// 首页：一句话介绍、安装命令、三种标记的说明、全部主题。
import StarlightPage from '@astrojs/starlight/components/StarlightPage.astro';
import TopicGrid from '../components/TopicGrid.astro';
---
<StarlightPage frontmatter={{ title: '准绳 · 做软件的准绳', description: '一套通用的工程规范：每条规则写明必须还是建议、怎么检查、为什么、出处在哪。网页可查，编码 Agent 可用。', template: 'splash', head: [{ tag: 'script', content: "document.documentElement.dataset.home = ''" }] }}>
  <div class="not-content home">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-text">
        <p class="eyebrow">通用工程规范 · 给人查，也给 Agent 用</p>
        <h1>做软件的准绳</h1>
        <p class="intro">32 个主题，从架构、编码、测试到安全、合规、移动端和编码 Agent。每条规则写明必须还是建议、怎么检查、为什么、出处在哪，定期复核。</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="pr-btn" href="/topics/">浏览主题</a>
          <a class="pr-btn ghost" href="/install/">装到我的 Agent</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pr-code hero-code">
        <div class="c"># 装到 Claude Code 和 Codex</div>
        <div><span class="p">$ </span>npx plumbrule install</div>
        <div class="c"># 按项目生成 AGENTS.md 里的规则</div>
        <div><span class="p">$ </span>npx plumbrule agents-md --tags lang:go,kind:service</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="legend" aria-label="三种标记">
      <div class="pr-card">
        <div class="lh"><span class="pr-badge hard">硬约束</span><strong>必须遵守</strong></div>
        <p>有可靠出处，写得出检查方法。做不到就停下来说明。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pr-card">
        <div class="lh"><span class="pr-badge soft">软指导</span><strong>默认照做</strong></div>
        <p>有理由可以不做，但要写明理由和规则编号。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pr-card">
        <div class="lh"><span class="pr-badge pending">待确认</span><strong>还没核实</strong></div>
        <p>单独列出，不当成规则执行，核实后再转正。</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>全部主题</h2>
      <TopicGrid />
    </section>
  </div>
</StarlightPage>
<style>
  .home { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3rem; padding-block: 1.5rem 1rem; }
  .hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 2.5rem; align-items: center; }
  .eyebrow { margin: 0; color: var(--sl-color-accent); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9375rem; }
  h1 { margin: 0.5rem 0 0.75rem; font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.25rem); line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 700; color: var(--sl-color-white); }
  .intro { margin: 0; font-size: 1.125rem; color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); max-width: 36rem; }
  .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  .actions .pr-btn { padding: 0.625rem 1.125rem; font-size: 1rem; }
  .hero-code { font-size: 0.875rem; }
  .legend { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
  .legend .pr-card { padding: 1rem 1.25rem; }
  .lh { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.625rem; }
  .legend p { margin: 0.5rem 0 0; color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); font-size: 0.9375rem; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; color: var(--sl-color-white); }
  @media (max-width: 50rem) {
    .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; }
    .legend { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
